Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: JSON parsing errors

Verify the MITRE ATT&CK JSON file downloaded correctly
Check file encoding (should be UTF-8)
Validate JSON structure using python3 -m json.tool data/enterprise-attack.json
Issue: No patterns detected

Ensure regex patterns are properly escaped
Test patterns individually using Python's re module
Verify log file format matches expected structure
Issue: Missing technique details

Confirm technique IDs are correct (format: T####.###)
Check that parse_techniques() successfully populated the dictionary
Verify external_references contain 'mitre-attack' source
